{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00367",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.04,
      "end_seconds": 6.34,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "Hi doctor, sorry, the lift was out and I had to take the stairs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.29,
      "end_seconds": 10.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Right on time. Sit, please. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.36,
      "end_seconds": 20.83,
      "duration_seconds": 8.47,
      "text": "So, so the thing is, I've got headaches in the mornings. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.69,
      "end_seconds": 26.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "How long have you had it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.45,
      "end_seconds": 32.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "It's been two months, I'm fairly sure. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.37,
      "end_seconds": 35.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Any weakness or breathlessness at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.56,
      "end_seconds": 40.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Uh, no, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.25,
      "end_seconds": 49.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "Okay, have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.06,
      "end_seconds": 64.92,
      "duration_seconds": 11.86,
      "text": "Oh, for the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.1,
      "end_seconds": 68.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.91,
      "end_seconds": 72.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.81,
      "end_seconds": 76.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.11,
      "end_seconds": 77.91,
      "duration_seconds": 0.8,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.37,
      "end_seconds": 95.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Moving on to your background, any past medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.15,
      "end_seconds": 103.15,
      "duration_seconds": 6.0,
      "text": "I've got high blood pressure. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.62,
      "end_seconds": 112.41,
      "duration_seconds": 8.79,
      "text": "Okay, high blood pressure, that's already on your record. Good to know. Is it all right if a trainee sits in later? No? Fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.41,
      "end_seconds": 117.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "I'd rather not, uh, if you don't mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.89,
      "end_seconds": 123.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.98,
      "end_seconds": 126.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "It's telmisartan, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.35,
      "end_seconds": 130.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.84,
      "end_seconds": 131.61,
      "duration_seconds": 0.77,
      "text": "40 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.97,
      "end_seconds": 135.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.87,
      "end_seconds": 137.59,
      "duration_seconds": 0.72,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.31,
      "end_seconds": 155.9,
      "duration_seconds": 7.59,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Okay, do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.4,
      "end_seconds": 160.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Yeah, not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.92,
      "end_seconds": 164.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.86,
      "end_seconds": 174.72,
      "duration_seconds": 9.86,
      "text": "Not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.69,
      "end_seconds": 179.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.81,
      "end_seconds": 192.65,
      "duration_seconds": 11.84,
      "text": "Well, yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.46,
      "end_seconds": 197.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Can I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.63,
      "end_seconds": 198.33,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.13,
      "end_seconds": 201.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "Breathe in deeply... and out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.85,
      "end_seconds": 220.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Heart sounds are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.39,
      "end_seconds": 222.09,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.05,
      "end_seconds": 225.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Just relax, I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.76,
      "end_seconds": 246.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "There's mild pitting swelling at both ankles."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.22,
      "end_seconds": 247.92,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.31,
      "end_seconds": 277.64,
      "duration_seconds": 24.33,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Right, here's what I'm thinking. I think we're dealing with hypertension that isn't well controlled at this stage. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had headaches in the mornings for two months, and no breathlessness or weakness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 278.41,
      "end_seconds": 280.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.97,
      "end_seconds": 302.54,
      "duration_seconds": 20.57,
      "text": "We should do kidney function tests for hypertension. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. I'll start you on amlodipine, 5 milligrams, once a day, long term. You take it by mouth. It's for high blood pressure. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.51,
      "end_seconds": 306.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Okay, and I take that after food?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.82,
      "end_seconds": 313.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.88,
      "text": "Check the blood pressure at home, same time each morning, and write down the numbers for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.08,
      "end_seconds": 334.91,
      "duration_seconds": 20.83,
      "text": "Right. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse. Come back in two weeks. I want to be sure we're on the same page. How would you describe the plan?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 336.24,
      "end_seconds": 344.38,
      "duration_seconds": 8.14,
      "text": "So, I take the amlodipine, 5 milligrams, once a day and come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.84,
      "end_seconds": 350.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Alright, yes, exactly right. Okay, I think we're finished. Is everything clear?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 353.31,
      "end_seconds": 356.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "No, I think that's everything. Thank you, doctor."
    }
  ]
}